# Based on the gdx-liftoff .gitignore, trimmed to the modules this project has (sim, core, lwjgl3, teavm).

## Gradle:
.gradle/
gradle-app.setting
build/
/.kotlin/

## Java:
*.class
*.war
*.ear
hs_err_pid*
.attach_pid*
local.properties

## Game output:
# Desktop game logs written by LocalFileLogUploader (./gradlew lwjgl3:run runs from the repository root).
/logs/
# Generated by some libGDX tooling; not used by this project.
/assets/assets.txt

## IntelliJ, Android Studio:
.idea/
*.ipr
*.iws
*.iml
out/

## Eclipse:
.classpath
.project
.metadata/
.settings/
.loadpath
.externalToolBuilders/
*.launch
bin/

## VS Code (kept out of the repo, as before; each developer has their own settings):
.vscode/

## NetBeans:
/nbproject/private/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
nbactions.xml
nb-configuration.xml

## OS and editors:
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.tmp
*.bak
*.swp
*~

## Python (tools/):
__pycache__/
*.pyc

## Windows "downloaded from the internet" markers:
*:Zone.Identifier

## Secrets: never commit Firebase service-account keys (CLAUDE.md Part G).
*service-account*.json
*serviceAccount*.json
